@startuml
title Hypertension Stages — ЛР 4 (Sequence)
actor "Пользователь" as U
participant "SPA" as Front
participant "Auth domain" as Auth
participant "Hypertension Stages domain" as Stages
U -> Front: Ввод логина и пароля
Front -> Auth: POST /api/auth/login(username,password)
Auth --> Front: 200 access_token (JWT)
Front -> Stages: GET /api/hypertension_stages?filter=... (Bearer)
Stages --> Front: 200 hypertension_stages[], is_owner
Front -> Stages: POST /api/hypertension_stages(title,image,video,SBP,DBP; JWT)
Stages --> Front: 201 hypertension_stage(id,status=черновик)
Front -> Stages: GET /api/draft (JWT)
Stages --> Front: 200 draft(id, title, media)
Front -> Stages: PUT /api/hypertension_stages/{id}/publish (JWT)
Stages --> Front: 200 hypertension_stage(status=опубликован)
Front -> Stages: GET /api/feed
Stages --> Front: 200 feed(id,is_liked)
Front -> Stages: GET /api/feed/{id}?next=true
Stages --> Front: 200 hypertension_stage(next_id,is_liked)
Front -> Stages: POST /api/hypertension_stages/{id}/like(value=1; JWT)
Stages --> Front: 200 like(value=1)
@enduml
